  "content": "<h1>Create: Gears and Tavern</h1>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>Create和Kaleidoscope Tavern的附加模组，使玩家能够轻松自动化其酒馆。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>介绍</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>酒桶支持Create的运输系统</li>\n<li>可以通过Create自动生产葡萄酒</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>更多Create模组</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreatefluidlogistic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FluidLogistic</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-bettersaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterSaw</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreatephantom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Phantom</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cb5d9d7098bc13d77ac44f5a0ef0135bb1903a2d.png\" alt=\"酒桶支持Create的运输系统\"></p>",
